# Where this repo's intent lives.
#
# The skills' own roadmap is this repo's GitHub Issues, the same arrangement
# Sidebar, SidePocket and Afterwards moved to: the issue number is the item id,
# intent is an `intent:` label or the closed state, and `Depends on:` is the
# first body line. Nothing here was ever markdown, so no item carries an
# `RM-NN` title alias — ids are bare numbers and branches are `<issue>-<slug>`.
#
# An issue is an item only if it carries the `roadmap` label; an unlabelled one
# is deliberately invisible to the board.
#
# Why this file exists at all: without it every roadmap skill stops on sight
# ("this repo is not on issues yet"), so work on the skills could never be
# picked up as an item, never carry a start comment, and never appear on a
# board. A session changing the skills was invisible by construction — which is
# the failure this file closes.
repo: saintsim/scarps-skills
kind: github-issues
